{"seq":1,"slug":"production-deployment","title":"生产环境部署架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/operations/production-deployment","wordCount":983,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"生产环境部署架构\">生产环境部署架构</h1><p>将分布式追踪系统从&quot;开发环境能跑&quot;推到&quot;每秒百万 Span 稳定运行&quot;是一个系统工程问题。部署架构的选择影响可靠性、延迟、成本和运维复杂度的方方面面。本文系统讲解从单节点到多集群的部署拓扑演进，给出经过验证的生产级架构方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>生产部署架构的核心决策是分层与职责隔离：数据接收（Agent）、数据治理（Gateway）和数据存储（Backend）各司其职，每层可独立扩缩、独立故障恢复。这种分层模型是应对百万级 Span 吞吐的工程基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部署拓扑演进\">部署拓扑演进</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph L1[&quot;Level 1: 单体 All-in-One&quot;]&#10;        APP1[&quot;应用&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;OTLP&quot;| AIO[&quot;Tempo/Jaeger&lt;br/&gt;All-in-One&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph L2[&quot;Level 2: Agent + Backend&quot;]&#10;        APP2[&quot;应用&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;OTLP&quot;| AGENT[&quot;OTel Collector&lt;br/&gt;(Agent)&quot;]&#10;        AGENT --&gt;|&quot;OTLP&quot;| BACKEND[&quot;Tempo/Jaeger&lt;br/&gt;Backend&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph L3[&quot;Level 3: Agent + Gateway + Backend&quot;]&#10;        APP3[&quot;应用&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;OTLP&quot;| AG3[&quot;Agent&lt;br/&gt;(DaemonSet)&quot;]&#10;        AG3 --&gt;|&quot;OTLP&quot;| GW[&quot;Gateway&lt;br/&gt;(Deployment)&quot;]&#10;        GW --&gt;|&quot;OTLP&quot;| BE3[&quot;Tempo&lt;br/&gt;(Microservices)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph L1[\"Level 1: 单体 All-in-One\"]\n        APP1[\"应用\"] --&gt;|\"OTLP\"| AIO[\"Tempo/Jaeger&lt;br/&gt;All-in-One\"]\n    end\n    subgraph L2[\"Level 2: Agent + Backend\"]\n        APP2[\"应用\"] --&gt;|\"OTLP\"| AGENT[\"OTel Collector&lt;br/&gt;(Agent)\"]\n        AGENT --&gt;|\"OTLP\"| BACKEND[\"Tempo/Jaeger&lt;br/&gt;Backend\"]\n    end\n    subgraph L3[\"Level 3: Agent + Gateway + Backend\"]\n        APP3[\"应用\"] --&gt;|\"OTLP\"| AG3[\"Agent&lt;br/&gt;(DaemonSet)\"]\n        AG3 --&gt;|\"OTLP\"| GW[\"Gateway&lt;br/&gt;(Deployment)\"]\n        GW --&gt;|\"OTLP\"| BE3[\"Tempo&lt;br/&gt;(Microservices)\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>Span/s</th>\n<th>组件数</th>\n<th>高可用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>All-in-One</td>\n<td>开发/测试</td>\n<td>&lt; 1K</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Agent + Backend</td>\n<td>小型生产</td>\n<td>1K-50K</td>\n<td>3-5</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Agent + Gateway + Backend</td>\n<td>中大型生产</td>\n<td>50K-1M+</td>\n<td>10+</td>\n<td>完全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐生产架构-三层分离\">推荐生产架构：三层分离</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Apps[&quot;应用层 (每个 Pod)&quot;]&#10;        SDK[&quot;OTel SDK&quot;]&#10;        EBPF[&quot;eBPF Agent&lt;br/&gt;(DaemonSet)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph AgentLayer[&quot;Agent 层 (每个 Node)&quot;]&#10;        OCA[&quot;OTel Collector Agent&lt;br/&gt;- memory_limiter&lt;br/&gt;- batch&lt;br/&gt;- filter (health check)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph GatewayLayer[&quot;Gateway 层 (独立 Deployment)&quot;]&#10;        LB[&quot;Load Balancing&lt;br/&gt;(TraceID hash)&quot;]&#10;        OCG1[&quot;Gateway #1&lt;br/&gt;- tail_sampling&lt;br/&gt;- attributes&quot;]&#10;        OCG2[&quot;Gateway #2&quot;]&#10;        OCG3[&quot;Gateway #3&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph StorageLayer[&quot;存储层&quot;]&#10;        TEMPO[&quot;Grafana Tempo 3.0&lt;br/&gt;(Microservices Mode)&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;Object Storage&lt;br/&gt;(S3/GCS)&quot;]&#10;        KAFKA2[&quot;Kafka&lt;br/&gt;(Tempo 内部缓冲)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    SDK --&gt; OCA&#10;    EBPF --&gt; OCA&#10;    OCA --&gt; LB&#10;    LB --&gt; OCG1&#10;    LB --&gt; OCG2&#10;    LB --&gt; OCG3&#10;    OCG1 --&gt; TEMPO&#10;    OCG2 --&gt; TEMPO&#10;    OCG3 --&gt; TEMPO&#10;    TEMPO --&gt; KAFKA2&#10;    KAFKA2 --&gt; S3\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Apps[\"应用层 (每个 Pod)\"]\n        SDK[\"OTel SDK\"]\n        EBPF[\"eBPF Agent&lt;br/&gt;(DaemonSet)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph AgentLayer[\"Agent 层 (每个 Node)\"]\n        OCA[\"OTel Collector Agent&lt;br/&gt;- memory_limiter&lt;br/&gt;- batch&lt;br/&gt;- filter (health check)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph GatewayLayer[\"Gateway 层 (独立 Deployment)\"]\n        LB[\"Load Balancing&lt;br/&gt;(TraceID hash)\"]\n        OCG1[\"Gateway #1&lt;br/&gt;- tail_sampling&lt;br/&gt;- attributes\"]\n        OCG2[\"Gateway #2\"]\n        OCG3[\"Gateway #3\"]\n    end\n    subgraph StorageLayer[\"存储层\"]\n        TEMPO[\"Grafana Tempo 3.0&lt;br/&gt;(Microservices Mode)\"]\n        S3[\"Object Storage&lt;br/&gt;(S3/GCS)\"]\n        KAFKA2[\"Kafka&lt;br/&gt;(Tempo 内部缓冲)\"]\n    end\n\n    SDK --&gt; OCA\n    EBPF --&gt; OCA\n    OCA --&gt; LB\n    LB --&gt; OCG1\n    LB --&gt; OCG2\n    LB --&gt; OCG3\n    OCG1 --&gt; TEMPO\n    OCG2 --&gt; TEMPO\n    OCG3 --&gt; TEMPO\n    TEMPO --&gt; KAFKA2\n    KAFKA2 --&gt; S3</pre><h3 id=\"各层职责划分\">各层职责划分</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>部署方式</th>\n<th>核心职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Agent</td>\n<td>OTel Collector</td>\n<td>DaemonSet</td>\n<td>接收、初步过滤（health check）、批量聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gateway</td>\n<td>OTel Collector</td>\n<td>Deployment (3+ 副本)</td>\n<td>尾采样、属性脱敏、路由分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backend</td>\n<td>Tempo 3.0</td>\n<td>Microservices</td>\n<td>持久存储、查询服务、指标生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kubernetes-部署详解\">Kubernetes 部署详解</h2><h3 id=\"agent-daemonset-配置\">Agent DaemonSet 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: DaemonSet&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: otel-collector-agent&#10;spec:&#10;  template:&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: collector&#10;          image: otel/opentelemetry-collector-contrib:0.102.0&#10;          resources:&#10;            requests:&#10;              cpu: 200m&#10;              memory: 256Mi&#10;            limits:&#10;              cpu: 500m&#10;              memory: 512Mi&#10;          ports:&#10;            - containerPort: 4317 # OTLP gRPC&#10;            - containerPort: 4318 # OTLP HTTP\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DaemonSet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otel-collector-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">collector</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otel/opentelemetry-collector-contrib:0.102.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">200m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">256Mi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">500m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">512Mi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">containerPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4317</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # OTLP gRPC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">containerPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4318</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # OTLP HTTP</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"gateway-deployment-资源规划\">Gateway Deployment 资源规划</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Span/s (入站)</th>\n<th>副本数</th>\n<th>CPU/副本</th>\n<th>Memory/副本</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10K</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1 core</td>\n<td>1 GB</td>\n<td>最小 HA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100K</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2 cores</td>\n<td>4 GB</td>\n<td>中等规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>500K</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4 cores</td>\n<td>8 GB</td>\n<td>尾采样需要更多内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1M+</td>\n<td>8+</td>\n<td>8 cores</td>\n<td>16 GB</td>\n<td>大规模，需水平扩展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>尾采样对内存的需求取决于 <code>decision_wait</code> × 入站 Span 速率。30 秒等待窗口、100K span/s 时需要缓存约 300 万 Span 。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tempo-3-0-microservices-部署\">Tempo 3.0 Microservices 部署</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>副本</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>扩缩策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Distributor</td>\n<td>3+</td>\n<td>接收 OTLP、分发到 Kafka</td>\n<td>按 CPU 水平扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Block Builder</td>\n<td>3+</td>\n<td>从 Kafka 消费、构建 Parquet 块</td>\n<td>按 Kafka lag 扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Live Store</td>\n<td>2+ (多 AZ)</td>\n<td>服务最近数据查询</td>\n<td>按内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Query Frontend</td>\n<td>2+</td>\n<td>查询切分和缓存</td>\n<td>按 QPS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Querier</td>\n<td>3+</td>\n<td>执行查询</td>\n<td>按查询延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backend Scheduler</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>调度压缩任务</td>\n<td>单实例（HA 通过选举）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backend Worker</td>\n<td>2+</td>\n<td>执行压缩</td>\n<td>按积压任务数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多集群与跨地域部署\">多集群与跨地域部署</h2><p>大型组织通常有多个 Kubernetes 集群分布在不同地域，追踪数据需要统一查询：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph RegionA[&quot;Region A (us-east)&quot;]&#10;        CA[&quot;Cluster A&lt;br/&gt;Agent + Gateway&quot;]&#10;        TA[&quot;Tempo (Local)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph RegionB[&quot;Region B (eu-west)&quot;]&#10;        CB[&quot;Cluster B&lt;br/&gt;Agent + Gateway&quot;]&#10;        TB[&quot;Tempo (Local)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Central[&quot;Central Query&quot;]&#10;        QF[&quot;Query Frontend&lt;br/&gt;(联邦查询)&quot;]&#10;        GRAF[&quot;Grafana&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    CA --&gt; TA&#10;    CB --&gt; TB&#10;    QF --&gt; TA&#10;    QF --&gt; TB&#10;    GRAF --&gt; QF\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph RegionA[\"Region A (us-east)\"]\n        CA[\"Cluster A&lt;br/&gt;Agent + Gateway\"]\n        TA[\"Tempo (Local)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph RegionB[\"Region B (eu-west)\"]\n        CB[\"Cluster B&lt;br/&gt;Agent + Gateway\"]\n        TB[\"Tempo (Local)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Central[\"Central Query\"]\n        QF[\"Query Frontend&lt;br/&gt;(联邦查询)\"]\n        GRAF[\"Grafana\"]\n    end\n    CA --&gt; TA\n    CB --&gt; TB\n    QF --&gt; TA\n    QF --&gt; TB\n    GRAF --&gt; QF</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>写路径</th>\n<th>读路径</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>集中式</td>\n<td>所有集群→中心 Tempo</td>\n<td>查询中心 Tempo</td>\n<td>总量 &lt; 500K span/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式 + 联邦查询</td>\n<td>每地域独立 Tempo</td>\n<td>Grafana Multi-Tempo 数据源</td>\n<td>大规模、数据合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式 + 复制</td>\n<td>每地域独立，关键数据跨地域复制</td>\n<td>任一地域可查全量</td>\n<td>金融/关键业务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"网络与安全配置\">网络与安全配置</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>连接</th>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>加密</th>\n<th>认证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SDK → Agent</td>\n<td>OTLP gRPC/HTTP</td>\n<td>集群内可选</td>\n<td>Bearer Token / mTLS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Agent → Gateway</td>\n<td>OTLP gRPC</td>\n<td>TLS</td>\n<td>mTLS (推荐)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gateway → Tempo</td>\n<td>OTLP gRPC</td>\n<td>TLS</td>\n<td>mTLS + 租户头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tempo → Object Storage</td>\n<td>HTTPS</td>\n<td>TLS</td>\n<td>IAM (AWS/GCP)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产安全最佳实践：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Agent 只暴露必要端口（4317/4318），不对外暴露管理端口</li>\n<li>Gateway 不接受来自集群外的直接连接</li>\n<li>多租户场景下通过 <code>X-Scope-OrgID</code> header 隔离数据</li>\n<li>敏感 Attributes 在 Gateway 层通过 <code>attributes</code> processor 脱敏</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"容量规划公式\">容量规划公式</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"存储量/天 = Span/s × 86400 × 平均 Span 大小(bytes) × (1 - 采样丢弃率)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>存储量/天 = Span/s × 86400 × 平均 Span 大小(bytes) × (1 - 采样丢弃率)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平均 Span 大小</td>\n<td>500-2000 bytes</td>\n<td>取决于 Attributes 数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样保留率</td>\n<td>10-30%</td>\n<td>SDK + Tail 组合后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩率</td>\n<td>5-10x</td>\n<td>vParquet 列式压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留天数</td>\n<td>7-30 天</td>\n<td>按业务需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>示例：100K span/s、1KB/span、10% 保留、7x 压缩</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"= 100,000 × 86,400 × 1,000 × 0.1 / 7 / 1024^3&#10;≈ 177 GB/天 (压缩后存储)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>= 100,000 × 86,400 × 1,000 × 0.1 / 7 / 1024^3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>≈ 177 GB/天 (压缩后存储)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生产推荐三层架构：Agent (DaemonSet) + Gateway (Deployment) + Backend (Microservices)</li>\n<li>Agent 负责本地聚合与过滤，Gateway 负责全局采样与脱敏</li>\n<li>Tempo 3.0 读写分离架构天然支持独立扩缩</li>\n<li>多集群部署优先选择&quot;分布式 + 联邦查询&quot;兼顾性能与合规</li>\n<li>容量规划需考虑采样率、压缩率和保留策略</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"performance-optimization\">性能优化与成本控制</a>：部署后如何持续优化追踪系统的效率</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../service-mesh/operations/observability-integration\">服务网格中的可观测性集成</a>：Mesh 环境下追踪系统的特殊部署考虑</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生产环境部署架构","id":"生产环境部署架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"部署拓扑演进","id":"部署拓扑演进"},{"level":2,"text":"推荐生产架构：三层分离","id":"推荐生产架构-三层分离"},{"level":3,"text":"各层职责划分","id":"各层职责划分"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubernetes 部署详解","id":"kubernetes-部署详解"},{"level":3,"text":"Agent DaemonSet 配置","id":"agent-daemonset-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Gateway Deployment 资源规划","id":"gateway-deployment-资源规划"},{"level":3,"text":"Tempo 3.0 Microservices 部署","id":"tempo-3-0-microservices-部署"},{"level":2,"text":"多集群与跨地域部署","id":"多集群与跨地域部署"},{"level":2,"text":"网络与安全配置","id":"网络与安全配置"},{"level":2,"text":"容量规划公式","id":"容量规划公式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"追踪可视化与分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/analysis/trace-visualization"},"next":{"title":"性能优化与成本控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/operations/performance-optimization"}}